      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我绝对──会在“有马纪念”取得优胜！\n这是为了把幸福送给\n让我对自己感到骄傲的人们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5004dfca96aef33e3264a11f97fca38608765bf849924b3c23fca7c683bc7c43",
